[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887143156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106495#issuecomment-2887143156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106495","id":2887143156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sFk70","user":{"login":"Chapien","id":2068976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg5NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2068976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien","html_url":"https://github.com/Chapien","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chapien/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T16:09:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T16:09:22Z","body":"Since it might be relevant, here's my `gcc --version`\n```\ngcc (GCC) 15.1.1 20250425 (Red Hat 15.1.1-1)\nCopyright (C) 2025 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\nThis is free software; see the source for copying conditions.  There is NO\nwarranty; not even for MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\n```\nAnd my `clang --version`\n```\nclang version 20.1.3 (Fedora 20.1.3-1.fc42)\nTarget: x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu\nThread model: posix\nInstalledDir: /usr/lib64/llvm20/bin\nConfiguration file: /etc/clang/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu-clang.cfg\n```\nAnd to demonstrate I have all dependencies:\n```\nsudo dnf install -y \\\n  scons \\\n  pkgconfig \\\n  gcc-c++ \\\n  libstdc++-static \\\n  wayland-devel \\\n  clang \\\n  lld\nUpdating and loading repositories:\nRepositories loaded.\nPackage \"python3-scons-4.9.1-1.fc42.noarch\" is already installed.\nPackage \"pkgconf-pkg-config-2.3.0-2.fc42.x86_64\" is already installed.\nPackage \"gcc-c++-15.1.1-1.fc42.x86_64\" is already installed.\nPackage \"libstdc++-static-15.1.1-1.fc42.x86_64\" is already installed.\nPackage \"wayland-devel-1.23.1-1.fc42.x86_64\" is already installed.\nPackage \"clang-20.1.3-1.fc42.x86_64\" is already installed.\nPackage \"lld-20.1.3-1.fc42.x86_64\" is already installed.\n\nNothing to do.\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887143156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887171634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106495#issuecomment-2887171634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106495","id":2887171634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sFr4y","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T16:23:02Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T16:23:02Z","body":"You're not missing the STL, it's just `thirdparty/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h` which is using `uint32_t` without including `<cstdint>`. This hugely happens when the stdlib changes and moves some headers around, which makes that whatever was transitively including `<cstdint>` in `SpvBuilder.h` in the past no longer does.\n\nThis was fixed a while ago upstream but our version is a bit old, so we should backport that patch:\nhttps://github.com/KhronosGroup/glslang/commit/e40c14a3e007fac0e4f2e4164fdf14d1712355bd\n\nWeirdly enough, I'm on Fedora 42 too with GCC 15.1.1 and I never had this issue.\nBut I usually do `scu_build=yes` to speed things up, which can hide such problems.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887171634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887197077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106495#issuecomment-2887197077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106495","id":2887197077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sFyGV","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{